An absolute file path is moved as written, its workdir the directory the artifact pattern hangs
off, wherever that is. A case cannot spell the sandbox path out, so the file is written `~/…`: the
file argument expands a leading tilde, and `HOME` is the sandbox's `home` root.

-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-run/playbook.md --
---
name: fx-run
title: Run
summary: Hookless states-bearing fixture for transition.
---

Preamble.
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-run/playbook.yaml --
state: main
graph:
  intake: []

states:
  main:
    artifact: index.md
    initial: intaking
    statuses:
      intaking:
        transitions:
          - to: researching
            when: intake complete
      researching:
        transitions:
          - to: done
            when: research complete
      done: {terminal: true}
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-run/intake/prompt.md --
---
summary: Intake the request.
---

Intake body.
-- fixtures/home/elsewhere/.keep --
-- cmd --
booping transition ~/elsewhere/index.md intaking --playbook fx-run
booping transition ~/elsewhere/index.md researching --playbook fx-run
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
created index.md
not-started → intaking
frontmatter: status=intaking
intaking → researching
frontmatter: status=researching
-- stderr --
-- expected/home/elsewhere/index.md --
---
status: researching
---
